  "title": "Brandywine Realty Trust Announces Common Quarterly Dividend, and Confirms Fourth Quarter 2025 Earnings Release and Conference Call",
  "summary": "PHILADELPHIA, Dec. 10, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Brandywine Realty Trust (NYSE:BDN) announced today that its Board of Trustees has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.08 per common share and OP Unit payable on January 22, 2026 to holders of record on January 7, 2026.",
